OL,3,ASupreme Court rejects Trump's
OL,4,ACalifornia ballot demands as Democrats
OL,5,Arally on midterms eve
OL,6,
OL,7,FElsewhere, millions of Americans have
OL,8,Falready voted, with a new midterm
OL,9,Frecord set in Georgia, where a third of
OL,10,Fall registered voters have cast their
OL,11,Fballots already
OL,13,FTrump's Republican party currently
OL,14,Fcontrols both chambers of Congress -
OL,15,Fthe Senate and the House of
OL,16,FRepresentatives. Democrats are hoping
OL,17,Fto flip enough seats to win a majority
